{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 879651357, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 86, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:00", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879650880,47288722,1508]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67289194]超越时尚A[/uid] (2026-08-26 10:57):[/b]<br/><br/>又不是摸一下4000就下来，肯定是站稳4000轮动一遍啊，摸一下4000怎么骗人[/quote]<br/>对 虽然可能很快  但是轮动一下的概率非常大<br/>这个思路是对的。<br/>但是只要指数走弱  就是要撤  因为轮动可能突然就暴毙的。", "lou": 520, "content_length": 109, "reply_to": 879650880, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787713253}, {"pid": 879652519, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 125, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "最后一波充满了竞争和不确定<br/>博弈太重了 <br/>光芯存导就是最大的斗兽场<br/>指数3900以上我连T都不做。这个瞬时博弈我做不来。", "lou": 521, "content_length": 107, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787713685}, {"pid": 879652987, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 47, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:11", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "如果早上收盘那俩券商都没开板  甚至到尾盘都板着<br/>那指数预期就不变<br/>但是科技预期就按我上面说的  不以科技本身为锚  而以指数时间节点为准。<br/>最后一波的主线万一是金融呢。<br/>是吧<br/>谁也不能说这个万一没有", "lou": 522, "content_length": 178, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787713866}, {"pid": 879653185, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 78, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:12", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879652845,47288722,1510]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=40888433]deeamarke[/uid] (2026-08-26 11:10):[/b]<br/><br/>假如美联储释放大利好，这波诱多有没有可能变成真多？[/quote]<br/>美联储听你的？[s:ac:咦]<br/>你等我打电话给GJD问问。[s:ac:抠鼻]", "lou": 523, "content_length": 38, "reply_to": 879652845, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787713946}, {"pid": 879653584, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 75, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:14", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879653124,47288722,1511]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67273693]小土豆二号机[/uid] (2026-08-26 11:12):[/b]<br/><br/>啥时候轮到国算啊，等得花儿都谢了[/quote]<br/>现在是调整浪 我在做成本<br/>我不知道你在预期什么", "lou": 524, "content_length": 47, "reply_to": 879653124, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787714092}, {"pid": 879653812, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 95, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:16", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879653488,47288722,1511]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66290604]kaleColourWgw[/uid] (2026-08-26 11:14):[/b]<br/><br/>听狼大这么说，感觉回本没希望了，离到顶也不远了，风险又这么大，继续参与别说回血，不大出血就是好事儿[/quote]<br/>你为什么指望在 指数级调整浪里面想回本的事？<br/>还是主升的时候肉都吃不上的情况下？", "lou": 525, "content_length": 81, "reply_to": 879653488, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787714175}, {"pid": 879654568, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 93, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:21", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879653787,47288722,1512]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-26 11:16):[/b]<br/><br/>那我问你果酸躺着拿到大5结束能不能赚钱&amp;#160;[s:pg:转身][/quote]<br/>可以", "lou": 526, "content_length": 9, "reply_to": 879653787, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787714481}, {"pid": 879655047, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 62, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:24", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879654852,47288722,1513]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66993211]我的钱哪去了[/uid] (2026-08-26 11:23):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，存在今天缓慢放够量的可能性吗，早上银保证拉的好坚定，看起来像在给反弹搭台子[/quote]<br/>放量就可以啊  但是一个上午才放了这点点量  太少了 <br/>指数1个点啊<br/>证明啥<br/>没人追啊 。没有场外资金进场啊", "lou": 527, "content_length": 94, "reply_to": 879654852, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787714673}, {"pid": 879655194, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 133, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:25", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879654853,47288722,1513]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67265639]柚子asd[/uid] (2026-08-26 11:23):[/b]<br/><br/>那我问你万一没有大5怎么办[/quote]<br/>哈哈 我故意没说", "lou": 528, "content_length": 19, "reply_to": 879654853, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787714723}, {"pid": 879655617, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 99, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:27", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你看  刚才如果哪怕你早上高点卖了半导体<br/>你告诉我接下来你麻烦不麻烦<br/>除非你就这里出场不玩了 不然我根本找不到好机会了<br/>因为如果走弱向下 那我就直接撤了  如果走强 我就拉高也撤<br/><br/>在这交易这个动作在我的技术策略里面绝对是不可能存在的。", "lou": 529, "content_length": 212, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787714875}, {"pid": 879669173, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 96, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 13:20", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这个缩量也太快了  <br/>我甚至还想做个反T 真是难受<br/><br/>反正没量绝对不能买就对了 。管他涨什么", "lou": 530, "content_length": 77, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787721654}, {"pid": 879670153, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 71, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 13:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "一点半 量能从放转缩。。。刚刚好。", "lou": 531, "content_length": 32, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787722210}, {"pid": 879670533, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 55, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 13:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879670269,47288722,1522]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-26 13:31):[/b]<br/><br/>你这给我整不会了  这是好还是不好[s:pg:哭]哥我最近心脏不好[/quote]<br/>肯定不好啊  背离这不是超短周期的卖点么", "lou": 532, "content_length": 41, "reply_to": 879670269, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787722424}, {"pid": 879712183, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 354, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 19:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "没错，这里很难，非常难<br/>我重新给你们梳理一下这段的行情。从3741底部之后开启的4-4已经接近30交易日了，我之前的判断也就是一个月周期，目前按我的周期就是接近尾声，再之前利用波动我已经把半导体ETF做出了50%的收益率，虽然总仓位比主升行情要少，但是本来4浪我是不做的，这次也是回来之后做一下给大家参考一下。总体上在指数第一次接近4000的时候我第一次把底仓给减了，后面做的几次T截止今天尾盘收盘价基本都还没有亏的。只能说不挣钱。为什么不挣钱。因为这里已经是末尾的末尾，更多的是细节的个股行情而非指数级普涨。我只能说我会有始有终的把这波做完，把技术周期和技术节点展示。因为我到目前仍然觉得小白和新手先不要考虑是不是自己心态不够强所以挣不到钱，而是连基础技术都不懂的情况下没有底气，没有底气何来的心态。<br/><br/>然后根据目前的行情，非常混沌，可能性太多了。有大科技方向受外围的联动做最后一次出货诱多行情，也有医药被美股医药消息带动仿之前半导体涛定律行情做一次顶部的延申行情，做双顶，还有银行可能的双头突破吸引跟风资金叠加今天第一次券商双板行情，所以金融也有可能带完最后一波。至少三个以上的方向在抢这个不到100个指数点的行情，特别是金融，就比如今天，还是放量转缩量的情况下指数拉出1%，你其他能挣到钱嘛？挣不到的<br/><br/>作为应对策略，这里首先仍然避开海外链，特别是那几个大公墓持仓个股，反弹周期内都能接近新低，那反弹周期完了你怕不怕他直接摁下去？我看不懂，我表示不参与。然后这里持仓和之前一样但减少做T，甚至保留一点现金去抢最后一波可能的那个主线，虽然可能就几天，但是也有可能很猛烈。不确定但是不分散埋伏。如果我看不懂我也宁可不做。一旦我认为行情结束，所有方向都大减，然后等。<br/><br/>然后作为历史参考，一般4-5之后整个市场会陷入更难受的状态，能涨的估计只有新股次新和那些妖股，你们可以参考之前这种行情。那时候我是真的不做了。<br/><br/>整个行情预演我从回来之后都是连贯的 没有说今天说行情是调整周期的反弹行情 明天就说这里能大涨走主升吧。", "lou": 533, "content_length": 1666, "14": {"13": 5, "14": 1, "12": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787744626}, {"pid": 879755960, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 85, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 09:40", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "券商连续2天2个板。", "lou": 534, "content_length": 18, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787794803}, {"pid": 879757510, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 76, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 09:50", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879757179,47288722,1566]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67248674]大威天龙来咯[/uid] (2026-08-27 09:48):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大现在行情不好空仓是不是可行[/quote]<br/>至少今天不可能空仓的啊。。。。<br/>我反正不空  <br/>我肯定要吃完最后一波的。", "lou": 535, "content_length": 69, "reply_to": 879757179, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787795433}, {"pid": 879757827, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 115, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 09:52", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "银行保险叠加新能源的利空压盘  足够了 <br/>至少能保证目前不太拥挤的2个大板块涨  只要药不涨，券商能兜着指数那俩不破板<br/>今天空仓我是完全不能理解的。<br/>怎么看都不理解<br/>MD 我吃肉的时候不吃  等吃翔再来嘛", "lou": 536, "content_length": 177, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787795560}, {"pid": 879759218, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 77, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 10:02", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "液冷终于做出第二次的成本了  2个票都3天20%了<br/>现在做第三个票。", "lou": 537, "content_length": 57, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787796142}, {"pid": 879760339, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 8192, "score": 69, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 10:10", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879760131,47288722,1571]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67142257]兰斯洛t[/uid] (2026-08-27 10:08):[/b]<br/><br/>狼哥只怕是也在液冷的弹性票 第三个票说的难道是大元吗[/quote]<br/>我TM缓缓打出一个问号[s:ac:咦]<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/27/axyfQ40